{"candidate_identity":"3b80917b733993bc73545563c4488aefb7e58e38be624ed5fa785a046dcbc04b","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b968623c4e035674854fd5465d4b0b4af4f24349ad4e5013e58b149404ea7b8e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c3afd9a55b3e0feec0a05d1f5720c0ef8a2893045a86093e6fcf6cf703f731e1","logical_entry_identity":"42102eeebc22f92733ab63333da7de26d63ac6f56d9669cefe720fc7381c1225","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"On the isolated Clork Peninsula lies the fifth pride: Kruk's Pride; unseen and unharmed by the Scourge.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在与世隔绝的克拉克半岛上坐落着第五部落：克鲁克部落；他们未被西方天灾发现，也未遭其伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"532ffc0adf7a63deb156689c8915281070025aaa642308e808be3111c0e823e4","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"dd2bcc97d76fe3cb854f018568d324785bdc428e1bbce2ef48b2855acd6392fa","logical_entry_identity":"e4be081c7278aaed3ed1d9f2fc2335b372a7a3699f29cd94f3023a3b2a8fc00e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Target a projectile in mid-flight to clone it and target that projectile independently. You gain ownership over the new projectile.","source_tag":"_t","target":"选择一个飞行中的抛射物，复制它，并指定新抛射物的目标。你获得新的抛射物所有权。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"adaf3c6bfbba72e0cc37d276346180bfdae93f7b7ce68ab31afa4bec1db99d7c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"dd30cccfa8333b991df59f9cf8d169e73b838b534edfdb79c38b0c36f3b209cd","logical_entry_identity":"29594370c55cbcbc91f6350b1506dd725c27aa29d34f35f882ba0e1b436d6020","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*As you approach you recognize Outpost Leader John. But there is a kind of terrible darkness, you can feel his hatred crystallize the air.*#WHITE#\n@playername@. You malevolent creature! #{bold}#YOU KILLED HER! YOU MURDEROUS DOG!#{normal}#\nYou #{italic}#dare#{normal}# carry her ring around like a trophy! I can feel it on you. Give it back! DIE!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*当你靠近时，你认出了那是前哨站首领约翰。但他身边环绕着可怕的黑暗，你能感受到他的仇恨令空气结晶。*#WHITE#\n@playername@ 你这个残忍的畜生！#{bold}#你杀了她！你这条残忍的狗！#{normal}#\n你 #{italic}#竟敢#{normal}# 带着她的戒指作为战利品！我能感觉到它在你身上。拿出来，受死吧！！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d27a833a98527a8f726c9097eee4289c76bdd4ddd46359eae6c6da7ae18a192f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"dd37453f83e7019b34a3c9b24b8cd6f850cc565cd41ed1641e1f771d28b004ec","logical_entry_identity":"9b26492ec76328f60fdd6d27de65433e4460bb992f458eab7efd7c5e4b5ef30c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"implants","source_tag":"talent type","target":"植入体"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b4d36e61adeee33fc5e2256473b23760372f4c2d3e099c48a4ce059c416c7d9a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"dd4dc78df685237fbdca21d4199b8650113ad1dfbd436259a9391b84c5ba1922","logical_entry_identity":"123439f2ceeb57271c74fd5c9535c3091deb39fa621c0b22370089120a6724c2","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Embedded Restoration Systems","source_tag":"talent name","target":"嵌入式回复系统"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3f039af9410d95d53f01a77eb068fd7d804b2210022dccb0bc468ab0f5471aca","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"dd5a35d069d559c035fa1b89abbe64b3ab6e94048b213153744152bb44e1883f","logical_entry_identity":"76fdd54d099669da6334f5fce6d55d5d66041a180e637936f98f73c95dbef988","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The skin of this creature is literally crawling with larvae, yet she seems to be moving toward you very fast.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个生物的皮肤上爬满了幼虫，字面意义上的爬满。尽管如此，她向你前进的速度非常快。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"028d2057fd30f7408fe7f77322c3f3d5dc4481d2861c8411757d7c725280132c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"dd5f6a8ecc4efbd6d3cc1ea8d1493deaf6adcb7d68e70bfd81611dd0c6da06c8","logical_entry_identity":"53a6d144ee0d8a5a33d30d03fef241f078c8a9c59a95b26c1d951d29dba4af55","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#target# surges with power!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#target#力量强化！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"81cd09b0ecf968290f8c1984f38e79b4d32561c22bede52dafdb8fa926fad109","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"dd5fd1b4d5f00d395ad514af34c8ac97f61af54b842fc20538ccd4064ee0f92e","logical_entry_identity":"75df81d4eacd7e23d8e85788ed7285dcae1dea6ffa0b2a36290b3f08bb30bd2a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"This is a matter most vexing.  Our digging was going well (if not particularly productively), and those fellows over in Geothermal Surveying told us they'd found a possible heat source, quite near an existing tunnel - but the miners started refusing to go there.  Copious complaints about assorted lesser maladies - nosebleeds, tremors, and general feelings of fear and unease.  On the other hand, a couple claim the vapors down there have done wonders for their clogged pores.\n\nFiring one as an example didn't work, and I have neither the time nor the inclination to get a bunch of layabouts to do their jobs.  I'm bringing in a yeti handler and excavating the whole area.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这是最令人烦恼的事情。我们的挖掘工作进展顺利，尽管谈不上特别有成效。那些进行地热勘测的同事告诉我们，他们找到了一个潜在的热源，就在一个现有的隧道附近——但是矿工们都拒绝去那里，他们都抱怨自己得了各种小病——流鼻血、哆嗦、还有各种各样恐惧和不安造成的感觉。不过，有两个人声称那里的蒸汽对疏通他们堵塞的毛孔大有奇效。\n\n光靠解雇他们来杀鸡儆猴是没有用的，我既没有时间也没有意愿让这群懒鬼好好干完他们的工作。我准备叫来一个雪人操纵师，让他们完成开采任务。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5d7876a0ac8e0e9a82ae5e3139f7d677eeab0a7d499fa31e5bfdb17aa4bd0fd8","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ddceb8365ff798773a0d50d5ca73bef94cc43eb933c99e1764a540704ce724c6","logical_entry_identity":"d3469dfb13175d2f391671f4120885d581d5c3a67e7e8bffc94ed659eee69122","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You fire an exceptionally lethal shot at an enemy, doing %d%% damage.\nDamage dealt by this talent is increased by half your critical multiplier, if doing so would kill the target.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你向一个敌人射出一发无比致命的子弹，造成 %d%% 伤害。\n如果能杀死敌人，那么伤害会提升你暴击伤害系数的一半。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ea2b55095a18dc09feb8e3f06b3d637689661104c9bd99c4d32380d0a27fc1ae","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ddeee354fe1816de9f9ca43626f8fbb80b5a98bf08b94770949ac94ed86c81de","logical_entry_identity":"267b1d8a1d7ec090d5d9dcba20367962705c3aa2deec49b3ae1b3b6225443098","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"[listen]","source_tag":"_t","target":"[听他说话]"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"71becdc1c3b5a5c70e2f3456cc36fdf8017e8ca98a4a4db369d41e88a379dd4a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"de362ec5c9ee5b42e39aebd3afe630cfc5053f73d21f467d37490e3dac0105cf","logical_entry_identity":"b077fe8fd6ca8c85cd7be70dc06e78ced3f120a37a04c492ea2cad5a969922e3","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Battlefield Veteran","source_tag":"talent name","target":"战场老兵"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ac4e6f282fe7ab630c5a496934c887fc6bc6d7b276f27c468c7d53caf5dede0d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"de418875373d81eccf64b1620d8b38c3fb153161abcdb71e2e18b2ceba7839bd","logical_entry_identity":"72e98f5d9d7db54a9b7632c65558914cef26806664743bbf37b81f73470f4c0e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"We of the Krimbul Clan have faced our near-certain deaths all too many times, even after our hearts stopped beating; this is the first time we have been shown the kindness of utter salvation by an outsider.  Those who were not enthralled by Nektosh and are not delusionally faithful to his \"cause\" will reclaim the Mana Caves in time; until then, we will join your Pride in your revolution.  You have liberated us, and we will not rest until you are freed of your oppressors as well.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我们氏族曾无数次直面灭族危机，哪怕是在我们的心脏停止跳动之后；然而，这是第一次，我们被外人的友善所拯救。那些未被纳克托什蛊惑、也未执迷于他的“事业”的人，终将收复魔法洞穴。在此之前，我们将加入你的部落，参与你的革命。你解放了我们，在你们脱离压迫者之前，我们都不会停下脚步。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3677a76f6a23341d36eb8494740bf7874cf58a835316334c455cb258924b82fe","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"de53aa3f4302f7c420e149112e5167163f11b9e38b9c1a557126a305a31f6195","logical_entry_identity":"050c7b2d34bc0644725c22cc0181bee1c3002ebc9724c3c0c44a060f86497864","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"moss","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"苔藓"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d148f340900b14fb0b773a1791985d560b81bcd2bec13dc1aaa78964f4643cf1","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"de845ced40c91e3b03e883cd4cc203905135b08961d54cdc03ad56669a3d3e03","logical_entry_identity":"476086af20231c49e934d55c5e91953b6370bdbaa688b0984a61faa3bb4a4525","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Reinforcements!","source_tag":"_t","target":"援军！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d6a1a994bf158fbf1bf0c6ef049ecd93755e780a1e26da873b80e63ed36d7e6c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"de8604a080091ae699fa28fe3b7527ca841b1f1a1acd615da495e5041f73efb2","logical_entry_identity":"7882a02b8d8a981960b910e65d05024a125c56e97b022487ba5f77a1976c3c8d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Lightning Web","source_tag":"_t","target":"闪电之网"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6d05c2747a3d7f08b0b8f8ed72ef48159f5804e929bc3dafc6da5dd4fddc0e0c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"de8f70cf7f23146a3c6f7f5663aac61f4f362b52952af9b8c9b55ad2b83be2eb","logical_entry_identity":"c5e7eda44e27fcae0b127d0c26ab47cd76b3c2eebe2392d190be1399506f8178","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Yeti-fur Cloak","source_tag":"entity name","target":"雪人毛皮斗篷"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"725fcd3e960c6dabd5c98d93040cf54e05a3cf901c1fa57fe12ccfc07eb265fa","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"de9110fd9728bc9d448fab4167994f06fab849b8a56706586356b077d3339d2b","logical_entry_identity":"f3f5e65c9ec569c803292052f540131086b644c9a7f43f31b586964ccc12f62a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The target is burning for %d fire damage each turn and taking %d%% increased damage from all sources.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标被点燃，每回合受到 %d 火焰伤害，所受到的所有伤害增加 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e1e4e5e5ed98f69245bd40d9d55302640e27a42202b313463a057d0667e979dc","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"deaa33aed0a76e1eb8d7244018188250670f136b654260a76cd02fcf2